      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'll read both the original test and the CUT source to understand the code before improving it.Now I have a clear picture. The main understandability issues in the original test are:\n1. The `assertEquals` on line 44 is a single, very long expression mixing the setup steps with the assertion\n2. No intermediate variable to name the expected value\n3. The sequence of adjuster calls isn't clearly grouped or labeled\n\nI'll write an improved version with a named `expectedInstant` variable and cleaner structure.Now I'll compile-check the file.The improved test compiled successfully."
